&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;"&gt;(注) １　主要な事業の内容欄には、セグメントの名称を記載しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;"&gt;２　特定子会社に該当しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;"&gt;３　有価証券届出書又は有価証券報告書を提出している会社はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;"&gt;４　持分は100分の50以下でありますが、実質的に支配しているため子会社としたものであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;"&gt;５　議決権の所有割合の(　)内の数字は間接所有割合を内数で示しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;６　上海中煉線材有限公司については、売上高（連結会社間相互の内部売上高を除く。）の連結売上高に占める割合が10％を超えております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　主要な損益情報等　　　(1)　売上高　　　　　　　7,538百万円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;                          (2)　経常利益　　　　　　　238百万円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;                          (3)　当期純利益　　　　　　273百万円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;                          (4)　純資産額　　　　　　5,291百万円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;                          (5)　総資産額　　　　　　5,936百万円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:13.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:13.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.5pt;font-size:13.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock>
